  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 503.02 Safety Equipment. It shall be the responsibility of the employer to provide for the protection of the employees, the necessary safety equipment as set forth on the labeling of the pesticide used, or by the board through rules.\n\nSource. #150, eff 1-9-74; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96, EXPIRED: 5-30-04\n\nNew. #8131, eff 8-13-04; ss by #10333, eff 5-10-13; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24",
